Add all terms (worst case):
- $V_{os}$ = {{Vos|V}}
- $I_BR_S$ = {{e1|V}}
- drift: {{TC*1e6}} µV/°C × {{dT}} °C = {{e2|V}}
- CMRR: 2.5 V / 10$^{ {{C}}/20 }$ = {{e3|V}}
